CloudBurrow patch 71 to github.com/goccy/googlesqlite v0.3.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1582).

A syntax error was reported without its position ("failed to parse
statement: Syntax error: Unexpected identifier \"blah\""), where an
analysis error ends with it ("[at 1:15]"): the script parser's options
have no error message mode. The statement that failed is read again by
AnalyzeNextStatement, whose errors are written in the analyzer's one-line
mode with the position in the whole query, and that error is taken when
it is the same one with the position after it.

